      "id": "b000037",
      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 59,
      "end_line": 75,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.StateModel {\n    id: progressState\n    values: ({\n        minimumValue: 0,\n        maximumValue: 100,\n        startValue: 0,\n        currentValue: 64\n    })\n}\n\nLV.ProgressBar {\n    stateModel: progressState\n}\n```\n",
      "language": "qml",
      "code": "import LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.StateModel {\n    id: progressState\n    values: ({\n        minimumValue: 0,\n        maximumValue: 100,\n        startValue: 0,\n        currentValue: 64\n    })\n}\n\nLV.ProgressBar {\n    stateModel: progressState\n}\n",
